                                        "entry_id": "8342665e-88e5-3066-9787-d0231abb5530",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Relating to Sir William Hamilton, 9th Baronet (1788–1856), Scottish metaphysician."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
